// The mutual non-disclosure agreement of Tidewater Robotics and Juniper Analytics (nda.md).
Document "nda.md".

Fact party Identified by Tidewater, Juniper
Placeholder discloser For party
Placeholder recipient For party
Fact item
Fact purpose Identified by ConsideringTheVenture, AnythingElse
Param term : Duration = 1095

// 1. Handing over, and 4. the three years that run from it
Fact knew Identified by recipient * item
Event learns-elsewhere Related to recipient, item Creates knew(recipient, item)
Fact in-term Identified by discloser * recipient * item
Fact already-known Identified by discloser * recipient * item
Act hand-over Actor discloser Recipient recipient Related to item
  Holds when discloser != recipient
  Creates in-term(discloser, recipient, item) For term
        , already-known(discloser, recipient, item) When knew(recipient, item)

// 3.1 What the secrecy and use clauses do not apply to
Fact public Identified by item
Event publication Related to item Creates public(item)
Fact developed Identified by recipient * item
Event independent-development Related to recipient, item Creates developed(recipient, item)
Fact confidential Identified by discloser * recipient * item
  Default handed-over-in-confidence Holds when in-term(discloser, recipient, item)
  Exception public-information Overrides handed-over-in-confidence Rejects when public(item)
  Exception known-before Overrides handed-over-in-confidence Rejects when already-known(discloser, recipient, item)
  Exception independently-developed Overrides handed-over-in-confidence Rejects when developed(recipient, item)

// 3.2 Disclosure a court orders
Event court-order Related to recipient, item
Act notify-of-order Actor recipient Recipient discloser Related to item
  Holds when Done(court-order(recipient, item))

// 2. Secrecy and use
Prohibited disclose Actor recipient Related to discloser, item
  When confidential(discloser, recipient, item)
  Unless Done(court-order(recipient, item)) && Done(notify-of-order(recipient, discloser, item))
Prohibited use Actor recipient Related to discloser, item, purpose
  When confidential(discloser, recipient, item) && purpose != ConsideringTheVenture

// 5. Return
Power request-return Actor discloser Recipient recipient Related to item
  Valid when Done(hand-over(discloser, recipient, item))
Duty return-due Holder recipient Claimant discloser Related to item
  Due within 10 days
  Created by request-return
  Terminated by return-or-destroy
Act return-or-destroy Actor recipient Recipient discloser Related to item

Clause 1.1/1 Definition => party
Clause 1.1/2 => purpose, hand-over
Clause 1.2/1 => handed-over-in-confidence, hand-over
Clause 1.2/2 Definition => discloser, recipient
Clause 2.1 => disclose
Clause 2.2 => use
Clause 3.1 => public-information, known-before, independently-developed, publication, learns-elsewhere, independent-development
Clause 3.2 => court-order, notify-of-order, disclose
Clause 4.1 => term, in-term, hand-over
Clause 5.1 => request-return, return-due, return-or-destroy.
